#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on utility-scale quantum computing featuring realistic use"
" cases and best practices"
msgstr ""
"Kursus IBM gratis tentang komputasi kuantum skala utilitas yang menampilkan "
"kasus penggunaan realistis dan praktik terbaik"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Gambar hero\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course focuses on today's quantum computers and how to use them to "
"their full potential. It covers realistic potential use cases for quantum "
"computing as well as best practices for running and experimenting with "
"quantum processors having 100 or more qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini berfokus pada komputer kuantum saat ini dan cara menggunakannya "
"sepenuhnya. Kursus ini mencakup kasus penggunaan potensial yang realistis "
"untuk komputasi kuantum serta praktik terbaik untuk menjalankan dan "
"bereksperimen dengan prosesor kuantum yang memiliki 100 qubit atau lebih.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disarankan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make the most out of this course, we recommend a familiarity with quantum"
" information and quantum circuits, at the level explained in the [Basics of "
"quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) "
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk memaksimalkan manfaat dari kursus ini, kami menyarankan keakraban "
"dengan informasi kuantum dan Circuit kuantum, pada level yang dijelaskan "
"dalam kursus [Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-"
"quantum-information).\n"

